msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Admin konfigurasie"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Basiese konfigurasie"

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Baie geluk, Piwigo installasie is voltooi"

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Databasis konfigurasie"

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Laai die konfigurasie lêer af"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installasie"

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "Net nog 'n Piwigo gallery"

msgid "Password [confirm]"
msgstr "Wagwoord [bevestig]"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "PHP 5.2 word vereis"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Jammer!"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Begin installasie"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Gebruiker"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "verifikasie"

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Welkom by my fotogallery"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Jy kan die konfigurasie lêer aflaai en oplaai na die local/config gids van jou installasie"

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr "Alternatiewelik kan die teks in die boksie hier bo gekopiëer word en in die lêer \"local/config/database.inc.php\" gestoor word. Maak seker die lêer bevat slegs die teks hier bo en geen nuwe-lyn karakters of spasies nie."

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Kan nie aan die bediener verbind nie"

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Verbinding aan bediener was suksesvol, maar daar kon nie aan die databasis verbind word nie"

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Fout tydens die skepping van opstellings-lêer local/config/database.inc.php "

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Databasisnaam"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Databasis tabelnaam-voorvoegsel"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Gallery se standaard taal"

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Moet nie skroom om ons forum om hulp te besoek nie: %s"

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Tot later."

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Gasheer (naam van bediener)"

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Dit wil voorkom of jou bediener PHP weergawe %s gebruik."

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Dit sal vir besoekers getoon word en is noodsaaklik vir webtuiste-administrasie"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Hou dit geheim. Dit laat jou toe om administrasieblasye te sien"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Benodig hulp? Vra jou vraag op die <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo aanplakbord</a>"

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Let op dat jy self die opstelling kan verander en daarna Piwigo heruitvoer."

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo kan probeer om PHP 5.2 te gebruik deur 'n .htaccess-lêer te skep of te verander."

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo kon nie PHP 5.2 opstel nie."

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Probeer PHP 5.2 op te stel"

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Besoekers sal hierdie adres kan gebruik om die webmeester te kontak"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Welkom by jou nuwe Piwigo webtuiste!"

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Verwys na jou diensverskaffer om uit te vind hoe jy PHP 5.2 kan gebruik."

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "ook deur diensverskaffer voorsien"

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "dit sal vooraan tabelname geheg word om tabelle beter te bestuur"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "kies 'n gebruikersnaam vir die webmeester"

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "tike assblief weer jou wagwoord in"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "gebruikersnaam deur diensverskaffer voorsien"

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr "wagwoord deur diensverskaffer voorsien"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "gebruikersnaam kan nie die karakter ' en \" bevat nie"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "localhost of ander, voorsien deur jou diensverskaffer"

